{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231100","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1023110001:1":{"text":"どうも、ご機嫌いかがですか？","source_cn":"嘿，老人家，您好啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CA137B955B08A7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1023110002:1":{"text":"ご機嫌は斜めだ！お前たちもろくな奴じゃないとみた！俺の家の前から離れろ！","source_cn":"我不好，你看起来也不像什么好人！赶紧离开我的家门口！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EE0B11C136423FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1023110003:1":{"text":"そんなカッカすんなって……俺たちは通りすがりの旅人だよ。喉が渇いててさ、水を一杯くれないかな？","source_cn":"老人家，不要这么激动嘛……我们只是路过的旅人，想喝口水...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8D7B3DCC70B86B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1023110004:1":{"text":"聞こえなかったのか？<shk>さっさと！消えろ！お前らにやる物は何もない！</shk>","source_cn":"你们是聋子吗？<shk>走开、走开！我这儿什么也没有！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2F27CFE3D5EB916","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1023110005:1":{"text":"うーん……これではロリエットさんにも会えそうにありませんね……","source_cn":"唔……他这么固执，我们很难见到罗丽叶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDCAB59A81630D30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu