ched","hash_xxh64":"0x23C83ED64EED2CF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1023110015:1":{"text":"お前を愛してるからこんな歯が浮くような手紙を書いて送ったと？この世間知らずが！","source_cn":"别以为他是因为爱你才给你写那些肉麻话，天真的小姑娘！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4860E16FDD54568D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1023110016:1":{"text":"あいつは俺たちが苦労して稼いだ金を狙ってるに決まってる！ろくな家も稼ぎもない奴が、お前を幸せにできるわけがないだろ！","source_cn":"他分明是觊觎我们辛苦操劳半辈子得来的财富，没有帷帐和金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x800A71269356B37D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1023110017:1":{"text":"家に戻れ！あの小僧と会うことは絶対に許さんからな！","source_cn":"你跟我回去！我是不会让你有机会和那个混小子私会的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EDD8CCD556EEB40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1023110018:1":{"text":"放して！\nジュミオに！ジュミオに会いに行かなきゃ……！","source_cn":"你放开我！\\n——我要去找朱密欧！我要去找他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A9FBB5B3EC71545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1023110019:1":{"text":"……面倒ごとは嫌いなんだが、あのおやじさんはさすがに薄情すぎだろ。","source_cn":"……我不喜欢惹麻烦，但这位老先生太不近人情了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC074E4FBD12584E7